Hence, the resultant of $\mathbf{E}_A$ and $\mathbf{E}_B$, $E=\sqrt{E_A^2+E_B^2}=\sqrt{(10 G)^2+(10 G)^2}=\sqrt{2} \times10 G Putting$ the value ofG$, we get \begin{aligned}
